"""Build every generated file of the academic paper in docs/paper/ from the results files.

    uv run python -m analysis.paper_build

Writes, under docs/paper/:
    _variables.yml            every number the prose cites, as {{< var key >}} (JSON, valid YAML)
    variables_map.csv         key, source file, locator, format
    tables.csv, figures.csv   index of the generated tables and figures
    _generated/tables/*.md    pipe tables with caption and cross-reference id
    _generated/figures/*      vector PDF figures and their include files
    _generated/appendix/*.md  appendix sections A-E (pre-registration, deviations,
                              disclosures, verdicts, data and replication)

Reads only: results/summary.csv, results/hypotheses.json, results/metrics/, results/gate.json,
the ledgers, configs/grid.json, docs/PREREG.md, docs/DECISIONS.md, data/, uv.lock,
pyproject.toml, the git tags, and docs/paper/upstream_sources.csv. Nothing under rt/, configs/
or results/ is written. No number in the paper is typed by hand.
"""
